{"event_type":"review","id":"631e209755bba41e61a8f063bc442163c622cb9ab2b2253699d758986102598c","occurred_at":"2026-11-08T06:40:09Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/16aadc9247f44323b5691f2f118b7e40811e3596f3c60938877508c7d40b2c24","sha256":"16aadc9247f44323b5691f2f118b7e40811e3596f3c60938877508c7d40b2c24"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4569d8d51d8d8875df790ed4c26c06c4b92717d062cff4d6bb0c1fdfe37b70cb","sha256":"4569d8d51d8d8875df790ed4c26c06c4b92717d062cff4d6bb0c1fdfe37b70cb"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f5032693add25a3944932c6ed651eb06a8c9585a3ebca604b0c152b931a00d15","sha256":"f5032693add25a3944932c6ed651eb06a8c9585a3ebca604b0c152b931a00d15"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/af670159078f0e65bb9cda7f09569d4d7cd199387572e5117d4a2b3b770d04a4","sha256":"af670159078f0e65bb9cda7f09569d4d7cd199387572e5117d4a2b3b770d04a4"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e63796f03ce319d23222496cde549f06430724cd7f4dc94ace832b12b31c1cbf","sha256":"e63796f03ce319d23222496cde549f06430724cd7f4dc94ace832b12b31c1cbf"}],"attempt_id":"17e39f699899cb8c69c18276912bccc232fad62368617cfa0a66e867c827d76d:0:1","base":"6278919b32df04ade94a799a918955bf696aafda","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"e56d800a793333b6ed5310487aef526705858ed2","body":"**Malformed `review_finished` timestamps now silently drop outcomes.**\n\n`timestamp()` now delegates to `parse_utc`, which returns `None` for any malformed string. Before this change, a non-empty malformed value raised `ValueError` (per the line-range summary: direct ISO parsing returned `None` only for falsey input).\n\nThe `review_finished` filter in `summarize` (Line 186) requires `at is not None`. A completed record with `\"at\": \"garbage\"` now counts as zero outcomes in `outcomes_24h`, `completed_24h_by_work` and `other_outcomes_24h`. `publish` still succeeds. The `read_events` comment at Line 259 says a complete corrupt record must never become zero outcomes. This change weakens that guarantee for the `at` field. The new `last_tick` check at Line 198 shows the intended fail-visible behavior for timestamps.\n\nKeep `timestamp()` lenient. `aging_deadline` and `starts_60m` depend on that. Add a strict check only for `review_finished` events. A missing or empty `at` stays accepted, as before.\n\n```python\n# summarize(), inside the events loop (Line 185)\nfor index, event in enumerate(events):\n    at = timestamp(event.get(\"at\"))\n    if event.get(\"event\") == \"review_finished\" and at is None and event.get(\"at\"):\n        raise ValueError(\"invalid review_finished timestamp\")\n```","id":"fde3c39e6320cfb3b7c89784a0a3143eb51cbd20d615075f769eeb7ae252ae52","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/status_summary.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Malformed `reviewfinished` timestamps now silently drop outcomes."}],"head":"5fdf6ec2e590fd3ef2a6da1fe56ed3dcb0736a05","head_tree":"1393f525755319d0614b0af7f33278d124294c49","input_scope":[{"blob":"b8acdee5189a98efeec2dfb632db9e0d7df90163","intervals":[[5,12],[18,58],[61,62],[64,116],[120,122],[126,130],[146,162],[165,165],[167,168],[174,176],[181,183],[186,230],[236,244],[248,248],[252,252],[279,282]],"path":"apps/crq-python/README.md"},{"blob":"e56d800a793333b6ed5310487aef526705858ed2","intervals":[[3,3],[5,6],[8,8],[19,20],[24,28],[32,45],[53,158],[160,168],[170,178],[180,184],[187,195],[198,227],[229,239],[242,245],[247,248],[264,266],[297,301],[331,331],[344,358],[361,361],[364,364]],"path":"apps/crq-python/status_summary.py"},{"blob":"48b1c4dd725e57c9a85788199aaa2c2c9db0aa6c","intervals":[[19,26],[28,41],[43,138],[153,153],[162,164],[176,206],[222,223],[233,375]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_status